A. Developer & Startup Tier (Free Use)
You may use the Licensed Software for personal projects, academic research, 
education, local evaluation, and within business operations, provided that:
  (1) You are not an Enterprise (as defined in Section 2).
  (2) You do not operate a Competing SaaS / Hosted Service (as defined in Section 2).

B. Contributor Commercial Waiver
In appreciation of community support, any verified Contributor is granted a perpetual, 
worldwide, royalty-free Commercial License to use, modify, and run the core Licensed 
Software for commercial operations, fully bypassing the Enterprise revenue threshold, 
